{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01216",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 8.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Um, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.06,
      "end_seconds": 13.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.15,
      "end_seconds": 24.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.27,
      "text": "Mainly an itchy patch on my wrist. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.34,
      "end_seconds": 30.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Can I check a a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.64,
      "end_seconds": 41.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "So, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.54,
      "end_seconds": 62.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 81 beats a minute, saturation 98 percent, BP is 112 over 80. What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.58,
      "end_seconds": 66.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "It's been like this since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.31,
      "end_seconds": 80.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.92,
      "end_seconds": 89.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Only moisturiser, and it's not much. It's worse with my new watch strap. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.62,
      "end_seconds": 93.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.41,
      "end_seconds": 102.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "It usually comes with dry flaky skin. The dry flaky skin? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.41,
      "end_seconds": 108.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any blisters, spreading or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.33,
      "end_seconds": 113.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Well, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.56,
      "end_seconds": 116.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.8,
      "end_seconds": 118.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.74,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.51,
      "end_seconds": 126.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I've got low haemoglobin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.27,
      "end_seconds": 137.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "yes, low haemoglobin is known to to us, good to have that clear. Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.61,
      "end_seconds": 144.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "my father had bowel cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.55,
      "end_seconds": 165.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.34,
      "end_seconds": 175.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Yes, diclofenac. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.63,
      "end_seconds": 180.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.55,
      "end_seconds": 183.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.21,
      "end_seconds": 190.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.2,
      "end_seconds": 205.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.44,
      "end_seconds": 229.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.67,
      "end_seconds": 241.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "it's iron tablets, once a day. I took the morning off to come in today. A plain moisturiser, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.41,
      "end_seconds": 248.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.7,
      "end_seconds": 257.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.73,
      "end_seconds": 262.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Take a a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.43,
      "end_seconds": 279.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "There's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.31,
      "end_seconds": 286.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "all finished, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.78,
      "end_seconds": 302.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.68,
      "end_seconds": 306.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.12,
      "end_seconds": 309.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}